Usage: omniroute [options] [command]

OmniRoute — Smart AI Router with Auto Fallback

Options:
  -v, --version                          Print version and exit
  --output <format>                      Output format (table, json, jsonl, csv) (choices: "table", "json", "jsonl", "csv", default: "table")
  -q, --quiet                            Suppress non-essential output
  --no-color                             Disable colored output
  --timeout <ms>                         HTTP request timeout in milliseconds (default: "30000")
  --api-key <key>                        API key for OmniRoute server (env: OMNIROUTE_API_KEY)
  --base-url <url>                       OmniRoute server base URL (env: OMNIROUTE_BASE_URL)
  --context <name>                       Server context/profile to use for this command (env: OMNIROUTE_CONTEXT)
  --lang <code>                          Set CLI display language (overrides OMNIROUTE_LANG)
  -h, --help                             display help for command

Commands:
  memory                                 Manage OmniRoute conversational memory (FTS5 + vector)
  skills                                 Manage OmniRoute skills (sandbox, builtin, custom, hybrid, skillssh)
  audit                                  Access compliance and MCP audit logs
  oauth                                  Manage OAuth provider connections
  login                                  Local OAuth helpers for remote OmniRoute installs (run on your own machine)
  cloud                                  Manage cloud AI agent tasks (codex, devin, jules)
  eval                                   Manage eval suites and runs
  webhooks                               Manage OmniRoute webhooks
  policy                                 Manage OmniRoute authorization policies
  compression                            Configure and inspect the OmniRoute compression pipeline
  files                                  Manage files (upload, list, get, download, delete)
  batches                                Manage OpenAI-compatible batch jobs
  translator|translate                   Translate request bodies between LLM formats
